    <div class="post-container" id="fpc-4126783">
                      
		<div class="post" id="post-4126783">
		<div class="long">
			<div class="head">
									<div class="options">
						<a href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,4126783)" class="btn btn-default btn-small btn-sm">Fold</a>
					</div>
								<div class="title" id="post-title-4126783">
																		
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nathaniel-prime" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1609974); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1609974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608973924" alt="Nathaniel Prime" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1609974)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nathaniel-prime" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1609974); return false;" >Nathaniel Prime</a></span> <span class="odate time_1548135840 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Jan 2019 05:44</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4126783">
									

<p>Consider the fact that the Foundation is all about Securing, Containing, and Protecting. I can see them ending up coming to the conclusion that alien civilizations should be treated in the exact same way, kept in technological stasis forever and studied extensively. Just like the Foundation is willing to do whatever it takes to prevent the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-871">the entire universe being replaced by delicious cakes</a>, I can see them wanting to contain an alien civilization to prevent it from <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3029">throwing a sun</a> at the Earth or releasing some omnipotent demon or somesuch thing. They could easily be an existential threat through either scientific or supernatural means.</p>
<p>This is double-scary for the Foundation since they would likely not be able to even tell if the aliens were using skips or were, in fact, skips themselves. Even some of their tech would probably be so alien as to still be indistinguishable from Earth skips. The Foundation's immediate reaction to basically everything strange is to put it in a box to keep it from eating everybody. If they did that to an alien civilization, I think they'd easily count as an HE from the perspective of the aliens.</p>

							</div>

								
					
