			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1488428">
									

<p>Were I an HE with the desire to eliminate humanity, I would, after assessing Earth's pitiful space-defense capabilities, divert an asteroid or three to impact. The humans would have no way of defending themselves against the attack; the planetary ecosystem would be virtually eliminated; and the danger to the attacking force would be minimal, and chiefly related to accidents during the process of diversion. Recall that <em>one</em> such impact is credited with the famed K-T Boundary&#8230;</p>

