														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1491924">
									

<p>I call this the Protoss Prerogative. In the original Starcraft, the Protoss were introduced as this technologically advanced race that weren't communicating, negotiating or even directly engaging the human colonies: they were simply glassing entire worlds. The reason for this? Zerg infestation, so low-key that the humans hadn't even realized they were there yet.</p>
<p>To quote Aliens: &quot;I say we nuke the site from orbit. It's the only way to be sure.&quot;</p>

