<p>But what if they wanted a *bunch* of that mineral? Like way more than what's on Earth? Like, say, the entire Local Group's worth? Their thought process might be, &quot;What if these creatures try and keep us from getting to the minerals? What if they've claimed these other planets as 'theirs' and then try and defend 'their' stuff? We should get rid of these creatures first, that way they can't attack us while we mine the other planets.&quot;<br />
Just a thought</p>

